re ritual. Crafted especially for those who like to cleanse like royalty…","gift_set":"$145","sample_kit":"$45","hero":"rb-cshow-royal.jpg","schema":"rb-schema-royal.jpg","matrix":"rb-matrix-royal.jpg","lifestyle":["rb-life-female-robe.jpg","rb-life-stack.jpg"]}},"pages":{"philosophy":"Welcome to Royal Being. We are a small community that started with a simple idea: bringing honest, plant-based, wholesome goodness back to daily self-care. We lovingly source pure, raw botanicals and transform them into wholesome herbal soaps that nourish your skin without any harsh additives. No secrets. No short cuts. Just complete transparency from nature to your bathroom counter or shower. Each of our herbal soaps are crafted by hand in small batches, and gentle for you. Every batch we pour is a celebration of the earth's natural bounty. We are deeply committed to your wellness and the health of our planet. When you choose our herbal creations, you are supporting gentle practices, sustainable ingredients, and a brand that truly cares. All of our products are derived from nature, gentle for your skin, and safe for you. We believe that what you put on your body matters just as much as what you put in it, which is why we formulate our herbal bars with organic, all natural, and ethically sourced ingredients. Every purchase you make, gives us an opportunity to live out our dreams of continuing in our pursuit of clean and sustainable skincare. We remain committed to creating products that not only nourish, but also replenish the mind, body, and skin.","about":"Royal Being is a small woman-owned business located in the USA. Each proactive herbal selection is handmade in small batches and in most cases, made to order to guarantee freshness, purity, and longevity of our products. All natural ingredients and essential oils used in our creations are ethically sourced and formulated in the USA. We offer herbal soaps that address multiple or specific concerns, alongside products that nourish your skin. We hope you'll explore our entire collection of wonderful herbal products. Welcome to our family.","herbal_products":"Our products are for all skin types. They are especially perfect for those seeking a natural and holistic approach to skincare health and wellness. Whether you are looking to unwind after a long day, seeking to boost your mood, or just to wanting to sleep restfully at night, our herbal soaps and products can help in achieving your mindful, wellness goals.","promise":"Cruelty-Free. Biodegradable. Formulated without parabens, synthetic sulfates, or phthalates. Made in small batches for our Royal Beings."},"robe":{"title":"The Royal Being Terry Robe","handles":["the-royal-being-terry-robe","royal-being-terry-robe","terry-robe","royal-being-robe"],"eyebrow":"Claim Your Throne. The Ultimate Post-Bath Sanctuary.","intro":"Claim Your Throne. The Ultimate Post-Bath Sanctuary. Wrap yourself in luxury and comfort - Treat yourself to The Royal Being Terry Robe - an indulgent, daily luxury that recreates a five-star spa experience at home. Feel the superior fabric weight, zero-twist absorbency, and tailored majestic drape.","price":"98","compare_at":"128.00","description":"Transform the simplest part of your day into a regal wind-down ritual. The Royal Being Terry Robe is meticulously loomed from 100% long-staple Turkish Aegean cotton, delivering the unmatched plush cushioning and rapid absorbency found exclusively in five-star imperial resorts. Engineered with a dense, premium weight and an advanced zero-twist weaving process, this robe provides an ultra-soft feel that drinks up moisture instantly while remaining breathable. Boasting a generous, oversized shawl collar, deep slouch pockets, and adjustable fold-back cuffs, it offers a tailored royal drape that never feels heavy. It is the ultimate lounge piece for slow weekend mornings, post-shower decompression, and evening relaxation","features":["Imperial Material: 100% Authentic, long-staple Cotton.","Absorbent Zero-Twist Looming: Breathable, Quick Dry, Thermal. Dries your skin efficiently while maintaining a cloud-like fluffiness that gets softer with every single wash.","Regal Details: Features a thick shawl collar, secure double-belt loops, and deep-set pockets designed to keep your phone secure.","Guaranteed Clean: Hypoallergenic, toxin-free construction that protects sensitive skin barriers."],"type":"robe"},"shipping":{"title":"Shipping","body":"Soaps are made to order within approximately 48 hours. Standard retail orders are then hand-packed and shipped within 2-4 business days, excluding major holidays. Shipping timelines provided at checkout are estimates from third-party carriers and are not guaranteed. Royal Being currently ships to the United States, the Netherlands, and Belgium. Risk of loss and title for all merchandise pass to you upon our delivery to the shipping carrier."},"care":{"soap":"Keep your bar dry between uses on a well-draining soap dish, away from direct streams of water."},"videos":{"brand":"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/117cb97df2d84d3797ee650ab396e790.mp4","watermelon":"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/4ea7ed019d114331a66343175f778527.mp4","duke":"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/73d871756d4f43bd8e1c1f56dd667d75.mp4","extra_b":"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/2fff40c66732440f996bd139b1162f25.mp4"},"about_copy":{"philosophy":"Welcome to Royal Being. We are a small community that started with a simple idea: bringing honest, plant-based, wholesome goodness back to daily self-care. We lovingly source pure, raw botanicals and transform them into wholesome herbal soaps that nourish your skin without any harsh additives. No secrets. No short cuts. Just complete transparency from nature to your bathroom counter or shower. Each of our herbal soaps are crafted by hand in small batches, and gentle for you. Every batch we pour is a celebration of the earth's natural bounty. We are deeply committed to your wellness and the