adiance. Skin-brightening Carrot Seed Oil delivers a heavy dose of beta-carotene to stimulate cellular turnover, while pure Lavender calms redness. Wash away fatigue and step into the light with a smooth, beautifully renewed glow.","price":"21","quantity":"100","science":"Elevate your glow with Glow-rify. A luxurious herbal bar formulated with Goat's Milk, and a skin-brightening blend of Carrot Seed and calming Lavender. A gentle bar that revives dull, tired skin and restores a luminous, youthful complexion. The powerful combination of carrot seed oil and lavender targets uneven skin tone, cellular repair, and deep hydration.","benefits":["Cellular Regeneration: Carrot seed oil contains high levels of beta-carotene and vitamin A to stimulate healthy cell turnover","Intense Brightening: Natural antioxidants visibly fade dark spots hyperpigmentation, and environmental sun damage","Anti-Aging Protection: Rich in vitamin E, it combats free radicals to smooth fine lines and improve skin elasticity","Soothing & Calming: Pure lavender essential oil reduces redness, balances oil production, and calms acne-prone skin","Deep Hydration: The nourishing base locks in moisture without clogging pores, leaving skin plump and glowing"],"ideal_for":"Dull, tired, or uneven skin.","profile":"","ingredients":"Goats Milk, Raw Honey, Organic Glycerin, Carrot Seed Oil, Organic Frankincense Oil, Jasmine Oil, Cypress Oil, Organic Lavender Oil, Geranium Oil, and Natural Preservative.","ritual":"Work into a rich lather, massage onto skin, and rinse to reveal a bright, youthful complexion.","safety":"For external use only. Avoid direct contact with eyes. In case of contact, rinse thoroughly with water. Discontinue use immediately if irritation, redness, or rash occurs. Consult a healthcare professional if irritation persists. Keep out of reach of children.","aromatherapy":"This product is hand-crafted with active botanicals, natural clays, and pure essential oils. We recommend performing a patch test on a small area of skin before your first full use. If you are pregnant, nursing, or under medical supervision, consult your physician before using bars containing high concentrations of essential oils.","hero":"rb-p-glow-rify.jpg","gallery":["rb-p-glow-rify.jpg","rb-life-female-robe.jpg","rb-schema-royal.jpg"],"aliases":["glow-rify"],"matrix":"rb-matrix-royal.jpg","schema":"rb-schema-royal.jpg","video":"https://cdn.shopify.com/videos/c/o/v/2fff40c66732440f996bd139b1162f25.mp4"},"the-rose-garden":{"title":"The Rose Garden","handle":"the-rose-garden","collection":"royal","collection_title":"The Royal Collection","type":"soap","first_glance":"Immerse your skin in the ultimate hydration sanctuary. The Rose Garden combines nutrient-dense Rosehip Oil with classic Rose and warm Vanilla to drench dry, depleted skin in essential fatty acids. This deeply emollient bar repairs your moisture barrier, leaving skin touch-ably soft, plumped, and velvety smooth.","price":"19.99","quantity":"50","science":"The Rose Garden is a deeply restorative, moisture-rich bar designed to intensely hydrate, smooth, and comfort dry or aging skin. The synergy of rosehip oil, pure rose extract, and warm vanilla delivers heavy-duty nourishment while reinforcing the skin's natural moisture barrier.","benefits":["Intense Moisture Lock: Rosehip oil penetrates deeply to deliver essential fatty acids (Omega-3, 6, and 9) that quench dry skin","Barrier Repair: The rich lipids naturally strengthen the skin's outer layer, preventing moisture loss throughout the day","Scar & Texture Smoothing: Vitamin A and C in rosehip oil promote tissue regeneration to fade blemishes and smooth rough patches","Anti-Inflammatory Relief: Natural rose extract tones the skin while cooling irritation, redness, and sensitive areas","Elasticity Boost: Antioxidants protect collagen fibers, helping to firm sagging skin and soften the appearance of fine lines"],"ideal_for":"Dry, dehydrated, or mature skin.","profile":"","ingr